.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH MORE 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
more \- Display the contents of a text file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBmore\fR [OPTIONS] FILE...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Display the contents of a text file
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-silent\fR
Display help instead of ringing bell when an illegal key is pressed
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-logical\fR
Count logical lines, rather than screen lines
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-exit\-on\-eof\fR
Exit on End\-Of\-File
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-no\-pause\fR
Do not pause after any line containing a ^L (form feed)
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-print\-over\fR
Do not scroll, clear screen and display text
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-clean\-print\fR
Do not scroll, display text and clean line ends
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-squeeze\fR
Squeeze multiple blank lines into one
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-lines\fR \fI<number>\fR
The number of lines per screen full
.TP
\fB\-\-number\fR
Same as \-\-lines option argument
.TP
\fB\-F\fR, \fB\-\-from\-line\fR \fI<number>\fR
Start displaying each file at line number
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-pattern\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
The string to be searched in each file before starting to display it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIfiles\fR]
Path to the files to be read
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
